dation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/classification/material":{"post":{"tags":["Classification"],"summary":"Classify Material","description":"Predict the material type of an uploaded textile image.\n\n- Looks up the image record by ``image_id``.\n- Passes the stored filename to ``material_classifier.classify()``.\n- Returns the predicted material and confidence score.","operationId":"classify_material_classification_material_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MaterialClassifyRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MaterialClassifyResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/classification/waste":{"post":{"tags":["Classification"],"summary":"Classify Waste","description":"Predict the waste category for a given textile material.\n\n- Accepts a ``material`` string (e.g. ``\"Cotton\"``, ``\"Polyester\"``).\n- Delegates to ``waste_classifier.classify()`` — same deterministic,\n  pluggable pattern as ``material_classifier``.\n- Returns the waste ``category`` (aligned with the project WasteType enum)\n  and a ``confidence`` score.\n- Does **not** require a DB session — material name is sufficient input.","operationId":"classify_waste_classification_waste_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WasteClassifyRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WasteClassifyResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer